@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #36546A
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Развёртывание — шаблон country cell (отдельно Nigeria и Kenya)
node "Country boundary: NG ИЛИ KE\nPII / keys / backup не покидают страну" as country {
 node "Primary local DC\nдва независимых узла" as dc1 {
  node "VM node A" {
   artifact "API replica 1\ncontainer" as api1
   database "PostgreSQL primary" as primary
  }
  node "VM node B" {
   artifact "API replica 2 + worker\ncontainers" as api2
   database "PostgreSQL sync standby" as sync
  }
  node "Country LB pair / VIP" as lb
  database "Redis public cache" as redis
  node "OTel / monitoring\nlocal key store" as obs
 }
 node "Independent local DC\nв той же стране; procurement gate" as dc2 {
  database "WAL archive / encrypted backup\nDR restore capacity" as dr
  node "Escrow keys + IaC recovery" as keys
 }
 lb --> api1 : HTTPS / readiness
 lb --> api2 : HTTPS / readiness
 api1 --> primary : SQL transaction
 api2 --> primary : SQL / jobs
 primary --> sync : synchronous WAL / node RPO0
 primary --> dr : async WAL ≤5min lag
 api1 --> redis : cache-aside
 api2 --> obs : masked signals
 obs --> keys : encrypted key escrow / before activation
}
cloud "Public Internet / PSP\nтолько approved data flows" as internet
internet --> lb : TLS / signed callbacks
note bottom of dr
DC failover: fence old writer → restore → reconcile → reroute.
RTO ≤60min safe service; RPO ≤5min; payment hold до сверки.
Вся страна недоступна: checkout stop, foreign PII failover запрещён.
Независимость DC и цены ещё не подтверждены.
end note
@enduml
